{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "glitch-vocal",
  "name": "Glitch Vocal Chop",
  "description": "Speech synth through aggressive glitch for vocal chop effect.",
  "graph": {
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": "ctrl-1",
        "type": "control",
        "name": "Keyboard",
        "position": { "x": 120, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "cv": 0,
          "cvMode": "unipolar",
          "velocity": 1,
          "midiVelocity": true,
          "gate": 0,
          "glide": 0.02,
          "voices": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "clock-1",
        "type": "clock",
        "name": "Clock",
        "position": { "x": 120, "y": 320 },
        "params": {
          "running": true,
          "tempo": 120,
          "rate": 3,
          "swing": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "speech-1",
        "type": "speech-synth",
        "name": "Speech",
        "position": { "x": 320, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "frequency": 180,
          "formant1": 730,
          "formant2": 1090,
          "formant3": 2440,
          "nasality": 0.2,
          "breathiness": 0.15,
          "vibrato": 0.3,
          "vibratoRate": 5
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "gltch-1",
        "type": "glitch",
        "name": "Glitch",
        "position": { "x": 520, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "probability": 0.7,
          "sliceMs": 60,
          "repeats": 4,
          "reverseChance": 0.5,
          "pitchRange": 5,
          "mix": 0.8
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "delay-1",
        "type": "delay",
        "name": "Delay",
        "position": { "x": 720, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "time": 250,
          "feedback": 0.35,
          "mix": 0.2,
          "tone": 0.4,
          "pingPong": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "out-1",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "Main Out",
        "position": { "x": 920, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "level": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "notes-1",
        "type": "notes",
        "name": "Info",
        "position": { "x": 520, "y": 320 },
        "params": {
          "text": "GLITCH VOCAL CHOP\n\nSpeech synth through aggressive glitch processor.\nPlay notes on the keyboard to activate!\n\n- Keyboard gate + pitch -> Speech Synth\n- Clock -> Speech clock (phoneme advance)\n- Clock -> Glitch clock (triggers slices)\n- Speech -> Glitch -> Delay -> Out\n\nSettings:\n- Prob 70% = frequent chopping\n- Slice 60ms = short vocal fragments\n- Repeats 4 = stutter effect\n- Reverse 50% = half reversed\n- Pitch +5st range = pitch warping\n\nTry:\n- Change speech formants for different vowels\n- SliceMs 20 = micro glitches\n- PitchRange 12 = extreme pitch warping"
        }
      }
    ],
    "connections": [
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "cv-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "speech-1", "portId": "pitch" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "gate-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "speech-1", "portId": "gate" },
        "kind": "gate"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "clock-1", "portId": "clock" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "speech-1", "portId": "clock" },
        "kind": "sync"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "clock-1", "portId": "clock" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "gltch-1", "portId": "clock" },
        "kind": "sync"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "speech-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "gltch-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "gltch-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "delay-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "delay-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "out-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      }
    ]
  }
}
